---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Apex Content Lab | Growth Systems Agency">
	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section style="text-align: center; padding: 3rem 1rem 2rem 1rem;">
		<h1 style="font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.25; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #38bdf8;">
			Turn Attention Into Qualified Leads. Build Marketing Systems That Grow Your Business.
		</h1>
		<p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 750px; margin: 0 auto 2rem auto; line-height: 1.6;">
			Apex Content Lab helps businesses attract, capture, nurture, and convert customers through email marketing, lead generation, strategic content, marketing automation, and short-form video systems.
		</p>
		<div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
			<a href="/free-blueprint" class="btn" style="background-color: #2563eb; color: white; padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">
				Download Free Blueprint →
			</a>
			<a href="/products" class="btn" style="background-color: transparent; border: 1px solid #475569; color: white; padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">
				Explore Growth Systems
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #334155; margin: 3rem 0;" />

	<!-- About Section -->
	<section style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; padding: 0 1rem;">
		<h2 style="font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #f8fafc;">
			Marketing Without a System Costs You Customers.
		</h2>
		<p style="color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.05rem;">
			Most businesses don't struggle from lack of content. They struggle from lack of a system — without one, every post, campaign, and lead starts over from zero.
		</p>
		<p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 1.05rem;">
			At Apex Content Lab, we build marketing systems that continue working long after the post is published. Instead of chasing algorithms, we help businesses create structured systems that generate qualified leads and support sustainable growth.
		</p>
	</section>

	<hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #334155; margin: 3rem 0;" />

	<!-- Core Services Preview -->
	<section style="padding: 0 1rem;">
		<h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: #f8fafc;">Core Growth Systems</h2>
		<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem;">
			<div style="background-color: #1e293b; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; border: 1px solid #334155;">
				<h3 style="color: #38bdf8; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">📩 Email Marketing Systems</h3>
				<p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem;">Build email systems that nurture leads, increase engagement, and convert subscribers into loyal customers.</p>
			</div>
			<div style="background-color: #1e293b; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; border: 1px solid #334155;">
				<h3 style="color: #38bdf8; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">🎯 Lead Generation Systems</h3>
				<p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem;">Turn attention into qualified leads through strategic lead magnets and conversion-focused journeys.</p>
			</div>
			<div style="background-color: #1e293b; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; border: 1px solid #334155;">
				<h3 style="color: #38bdf8; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">⚙️ Marketing Automation</h3>
				<p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem;">Reduce manual work with automated customer journeys, CRM setups, and scalable workflows.</p>
			</div>
			<div style="background-color: #1e293b; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; border: 1px solid #334155;">
				<h3 style="color: #38bdf8; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">📱 Content & Video Strategy</h3>
				<p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem;">Create short-form video systems across Instagram, TikTok, and YouTube that funnel directly into leads.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem;">
			<a href="/services" style="color: #38bdf8; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">View All Agency Services →</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #334155; margin: 3rem 0;" />

	<!-- Framework Section -->
	<section style="text-align: center; padding: 0 1rem; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;">
		<h2 style="font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #f8fafc;">The Attention-to-Leads Framework</h2>
		<p style="color: #38bdf8; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 2;">
			Attention &rarr; Lead Capture &rarr; Lead Nurture &rarr; Customer Conversion &rarr; Business Growth
		</p>
	</section>
</Layout>
